WEBVTT

1
00:00:01.500 --> 00:00:05.000
Lesson 4.8 · People, Culture & Volunteers
Volunteers and community contributors

2
00:00:05.600 --> 00:00:11.800
Volunteering is a two-way relationship: a clear role, real support and fair expenses.

3
00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:15.600
1. Write a role with time, tasks and boundaries.

4
00:00:15.600 --> 00:00:18.200
2. Check, induct and supervise in proportion to risk.

5
00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:22.200
3. Repay expenses so anyone can volunteer.

6
00:00:22.800 --> 00:00:23.800
An example: Imara Girls in Science (Registered nonprofit · delivering, Kenya)

7
00:00:23.800 --> 00:00:31.000
“Mentors: one club visit a fortnight for a year; references, police clearance and training; monthly mentor circle; transport paid on the day.”

8
00:00:31.600 --> 00:00:33.400
You create one volunteer role and its full journey.

9
00:00:33.400 --> 00:00:37.400
Then save it, and download it as a PDF.

10
00:00:38.900 --> 00:00:42.000
Method into Impact
Better foundations. Stronger organisations.
